{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:07 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15be3395a531645c98e9767131e2555c/2026-10/Copy_of_KF_-_2026-10-29T182614_049.png\"/>\n<p>NBA周三勇士作客對上木狼，球隊大哥史堤芬居里(Stephen Curry)今戰大殺四方狂轟44分，並成功守住木狼尾段反撲，最終成功以119:114力壓主隊取得二連勝。</p>\n<blockquote><p>CHEF CURRY COOKED IN MINNESOTA! 🧑‍🍳 44 PTS (19 in 2Q) 🧑‍🍳 8 REB 🧑‍🍳 6 AST 🧑‍🍳 6 3PM 🧑‍🍳 GOLDEN STATE W @StephenCurry30 (15 games) ties LeBron James for the most 40+ point games at age 35 or older in NBA history! https://t.co/LlkdYCLXvT</p>— NBA (@NBA) October 29, 2026</blockquote>\n<img alt=\"倒戈的古明加則以20分取得隊內最高分。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dc25286f3bfbe14f2855829a68d0cee/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2301978547__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"倒戈的古明加則以20分取得隊內最高分。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ff997cd8910c63eb5c1203485526b48/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2301978315__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"史堤芬居里(Stephen Curry)帶領勇士119:114力剋木狼。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bde0e31ff62162c37d613e0a5b34020a/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2302460055__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"倫德伯格則攻入26分外加9籃板，但同一時間出現了7次失誤。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/043378ce483ca22c2e0876d2183e95cb/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2301958128__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"史堤芬居里(Stephen Curry)今場火力全開，全場轟入44分，他更以35歲第15次得分40+，與占士(Lebron James)並列歷史第一。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ace785c5bb58228b1d113f02e410fca1/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2302460052__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"史堤芬居里(Stephen Curry)今場火力全開，全場轟入44分，他更以35歲第15次得分40+，與占士(Lebron James)並列歷史第一。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6424be255199120423a33c223520de5d/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2301944190__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"史堤芬居里(Stephen Curry)今場火力全開，全場轟入44分，他更以35歲第15次得分40+，與占士(Lebron James)並列歷史第一。AFP\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6cae481b58732abdaef86183770dbd9/2026-10/AFP__20261029__2302460058__v1__HighRes__GoldenStateWarriorsVMinnesotaTimberwolves.jpg\"/>\n<h2>居里轟44分平占士記錄</h2>\n<p>今個休賽季勇士並未有太多動作，加上陣中傷兵滿營如占美畢拿(Jimmy Butler)等仍未知歸期，因此一度被外界認為今季是否會「擺爛」，開季前三場勇士亦連吞三負，直至上場對金塊才憑新秀倫德伯格(Yaxel Lendeborg)狂轟31分下，才勇挫金塊開齋。</p>\n<p>而今仗勇士對上「狼王」安東尼愛華士(Anthony Edwards)缺席的木狼亦延續強勢表現，尤其是在居里半場便轟入五記三分獨得23分下，勇士半場便以64:48取得16分的優勢。但木狼亦未有坐以待斃，在第四節借居里下場休息的空檔，憑藉查頓麥丹尼斯(Jaden Mcdaniels)和杜辛姆(Ayo Dosummn)接連得分下將分差收窄至7分，但好在到尾段勇士再穩住陣腳，最終以119:114守住今場勝果。</p>\n<p>「咖哩仔」今場火力全開，全場轟入44分，更有8籃板6助攻和2抄截的全面發揮，他更以35歲第15次得分40+，與占士並列歷史第一。而新季倫德伯格則攻入26分外加9籃板，但同一時間出現了7次失誤。而木狼方面，倒戈的古明加(Jonathan Kuminga)則以20分取得隊內最高分，麥丹尼斯則攻入19分外加7籃板。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:10.546791+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":876,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:07:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:49.096727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:45.035375+00:00","content_hash":"90ec44f61ee655c3e8e5ad21422d2bb130adc32e508188cfcac18667836ef3ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}